    "summary": "Face-mask composed of two layers of cotton fabric. Mass-produced, lozenge-shaped, beak face-mask with an appliqué khayamiya (tent makers) interlocking arabesque pattern in green, brown, tan on the front face, enclosed within a black border. The appliqué panels are sewn on to a white backing. The mask has two black elastic head loops, one on the top and the other on the bottom, and a metal nose band enclosed within the black border running along the top of the mask. The appliqué panels are handstitched, while the black border band and elastics are machine stitched.",
